{title: Chhotasa Fasana}
{artist: Arijit Singh}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm]Chal pade hai jo hum,        [F]Ab kaisa bahana
[D#]Ise hai nibh [F]ana,        [A#]Yeh safar hai naya
[D#]Kya se kya ho gaya,        [Gm]Aage kya hai [F]aana
[A#]Bekhabar main yahan,        [D#]Befikar hai jahan
[Gm]Kise kya [F]batana,        Ki [D#]dil mera, [A#]hai [D#]banjara [A#]
Par [D#]mann mera, [A#]ye jaane [Cm]na [F],        Ki [D#]dil thoda, [A#]hai [D#]aawara [A#]
Par [D#]man phir [A#]bhi,        ye maane [Cm]naa [F]
[D#]Khuli aankhein [A#]dekhe,        [Cm]Manjar naya saa [F]hai
[D#]Dekho raahein [A#]pooche,        [Cm]Manzil meri kya [F]hai
[Gm]Ho pata laapata,        [D#]Kisi ko kya pata
[Cm]Ki mujhe jaana hai [F]kahan,        [Gm]Is safar ki wajaah
[D#]Hai ye farz ya saza,        [Cm]Ye maine jaana hai [F]kahan
Ki [D#]dil mera, [A#]hai [D#]banjara [A#],        Par [D#]mann mera, [A#]ye jaane [Cm]na [F]
Ki [D#]dil thoda, [A#]hai [D#]aawara [A#],        Par [D#]man phir [A#]bhi,
ye maane [Cm]naa [F]
